---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Policy | 10Best Living`} description={`10Best Living privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in compliance with GDPR and CCPA.`} path={`/privacy-policy`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">Last Updated</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy was last updated on October 1, 2026.</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">Introduction</h2>
<p>10Best Living ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website 10bestliving.com.</p>

<h2 id="sec-3">Information We Collect</h2>
<h3>Personal Information</h3>
<ul>
<li>Name and email address (when you subscribe to our newsletter or contact us)</li>
<li>Browser type and version</li>
<li>IP address and approximate geographic location</li>
<li>Operating system and device information</li>
<li>Pages visited and time spent on our site</li>
<li>Referring URLs and search terms</li>
</ul>
<h3>Cookies and Tracking</h3>
<p>We use cookies, web beacons, and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze site usage, and serve relevant content. You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
<li>To operate and maintain our website</li>
<li>To send newsletters and product recommendations (with your consent)</li>
<li>To analyze website traffic and improve our content</li>
<li>To respond to your comments and questions</li>
<li>To display relevant advertising through our affiliate partnerships</li>
<li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We use the following third-party services that may collect information about you:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> For website traffic analysis</li>
<li><strong>Amazon Associates:</strong> For affiliate linking and commission tracking</li>
<li><strong>Mailchimp:</strong> For newsletter delivery and management</li>
<li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> For website security and performance</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-6">Your Rights (GDPR & CCPA)</h2>
<p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Access your personal data</li>
<li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
<li>Request deletion of your data</li>
<li>Opt-out of data selling (where applicable)</li>
<li>Revoke consent at any time</li>
</ul>
<p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">privacy@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>

<h2 id="sec-7">Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy. Newsletter subscribers' data is retained until they unsubscribe. Analytics data is retained for 26 months.</p>

<h2 id="sec-8">Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our website is not intended for children under 16 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16.</p>

<h2 id="sec-9">Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of significant changes by posting a notice on our website.</p>

<h2 id="sec-10">Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">privacy@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


